                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "07b550c6-23b9-3a60-8e16-f8db6b0106a7",
                        "entry_id": "7f554364-46e2-3afb-80a6-74833e0f5c2c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар., истор. то же, что вольтерьянец"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc511fe6-b12d-4fc4-94a1-2531fdc3eb6f",
                                "sense_id": "07b550c6-23b9-3a60-8e16-f8db6b0106a7",
                                "text": "Меня самого волтерьянцем обозвали ― ей богу-с; а ведь я, всем известно, так ещё мало написал-с… то есть крынка молока у бабы скиснет ― всё господин Вольтер виноват!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82b3de33-ce15-4fd9-984f-16b207150415",
                                "sense_id": "07b550c6-23b9-3a60-8e16-f8db6b0106a7",
                                "text": "Был наш Григорий Николаич волтерьянец, и Лафайет с языка у него не сходил, а теперь лежит разбитый параличом да «все упование мое на тя возлагаю» шепчет!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e26f413f-2053-418c-9695-5cbff731186b",
                                "sense_id": "07b550c6-23b9-3a60-8e16-f8db6b0106a7",
                                "text": "Табачник и волтерьянец, как называл Смагина консисторский протопоп Мелетий, поселился в этом раскольничьем гнезде своим человеком."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3a7dd2b1-106e-474e-b721-ac1e6d31d893",
                        "source_entry_id": "7f554364-46e2-3afb-80a6-74833e0f5c2c",
                        "source_sense_id": "07b550c6-23b9-3a60-8e16-f8db6b0106a7",
                        "target_lang_word": "Voltairean",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Voltairean",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42672e1f-50e1-331d-9514-de9b661b1997",
                                        "entry_id": "33caaa07-5ae5-3cad-a70a-41857ed3eb25",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or pertaining to François-Marie Arouet (1694-1778; pen name \\\"Voltaire\\\"), French writer, essayist, and philosopher known for his wit and defence of civil liberties."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27ae1261-09c2-4962-812d-5bf7b7cc1dfe",
                                                "sense_id": "42672e1f-50e1-331d-9514-de9b661b1997",
                                                "text": "\"What do you want? Nineteenth-century rationalism, Voltairian deism? We're living in a religious age, you know. I suppose Anglicanism might be a solution.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c3d7c58-1503-4c5c-8fba-ed77ab00d708",
                                                "sense_id": "42672e1f-50e1-331d-9514-de9b661b1997",
                                                "text": "[…] the skinny boy at the next table smirked with a thin Voltairian sneer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Voltairean",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5225438-e9ae-3fc0-83f4-0ddb051ee854",
                                        "entry_id": "69a03a23-7238-3f1c-a5b5-9a6a6d8846a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who subscribes to the philosophy of Voltaire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db363039-357a-4c05-9f67-3f31fbb27e4f",
                                                "sense_id": "e5225438-e9ae-3fc0-83f4-0ddb051ee854",
                                                "text": "Then hearing that I was a Darwaysh and doctor—he must be an Osmanli Voltairean, that little Turk—the official snorted a contemptuous snort."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ead7160c-6841-4a5f-98c0-7584a9b399c1",
                                                "sense_id": "e5225438-e9ae-3fc0-83f4-0ddb051ee854",
                                                "text": "“[…] But as for saints and relics and things, I fear I'm a bit of a Voltairian; what you would call a skeptic.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
